  "description": "Deploy and manage apps, databases, and infrastructure on Railway. Covers project setup, deploys, environment configuration, networking, troubleshooting, and monitoring.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `use-railway` (Operate Railway infrastructure: sign up for or sign in to a Railway account, create projects, provision services, databases,…)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PreToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `railway`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install railway@claude-plugins-official` from `railwayapp/railway-skills` (`plugins/railway`).",
